    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your connection to this divine domain ensures you always have certain spells ready. When you reach a Cleric level specified in the Discovery Domain Spells table, you thereafter always have the listed spells prepared.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Cleric Level</th><th>Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>Augury, Expeditious Retreat, Fog Cloud, Pass without Trace</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>Clairvoyance, Haste</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>Control Water, Locate Creature</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>Commune, Passwall</td></tr></tbody></table><ul><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.9bec3cda54bd833f]{Augury}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.fd45a292f7d1a476]{Expeditious Retreat}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.746b572ef7dbfce7]{Fog Cloud}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.e3bf386e072b3364]{Pass without Trace}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.c91ddc178501713f]{Clairvoyance}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.fc974060cef52f28]{Haste}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.7c3bb8a4909570e3]{Control Water}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.f21b0bb8e562e009]{Locate Creature}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.f18820ac79c3301f]{Commune}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.cacfeda1534262aa]{Passwall}</li></ul>"
